sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title UC1-B Operator resubmits with targeted changes
    actor Op as Operator
    participant UI as React SPA
    participant API as FastAPI (api → services)
    participant ED as domain.editability
    participant DF as domain.diff
    participant WF as domain.workflow
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    actor Ofc as Officer

    Op->>UI: open application (status "Pending Pre-Site Resubmission")
    UI->>API: GET /applications/{id}
    API->>DB: load application, open feedback, revisions
    API-->>UI: operator view: feedback on top, editable targets = flagged only

    Op->>UI: click feedback item
    UI->>UI: scroll to and highlight section / document

    Op->>UI: edit flagged section
    UI->>API: PATCH /applications/{id}/sections/{key}
    API->>ED: editable_targets(status, open_feedback)
    alt section flagged
        API->>DB: update draft_data
        API-->>UI: 200
    else section not flagged
        API-->>UI: 403 section_not_editable
    end

    Op->>UI: replace flagged document
    UI->>API: POST /applications/{id}/documents (same type)
    API->>DB: new Document supersedes old, new VerificationRun
    API-->>UI: 201 (verification re-runs in background)

    Op->>UI: Resubmit
    UI->>API: POST /applications/{id}/resubmit
    API->>DB: load previous revision + draft_data + open feedback
    API->>DF: diff(previous.form_data, draft_data)
    DF-->>API: changed sections / documents
    alt no flagged target changed
        API-->>UI: 422 no_changes_to_flagged_items
    else
        API->>WF: transition(pending_pre_site_resubmission → pre_site_resubmitted, operator, ctx)
        API->>DB: insert Revision N+1, feedback(target changed) = addressed, status, audit events, notification to officers (one transaction)
        API-->>UI: 200 application (label "Pre-Site Resubmitted")
        Ofc-->>Ofc: sees notification "resubmitted"
    end
